# re-exported here so that scorer integrations import (and tests patch) them from
# ``mlflow.genai.scorers.llm_backend``. Referencing them as module-level globals
# keeps ``mock.patch("mlflow.genai.scorers.llm_backend._call_llm_provider_api")``
# effective for both this module and any caller that accesses them as
